"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Gesture overview"
msgstr ""
"MENÚ SUPERIOR / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Pulsacións e xestos / Vista xeral de xestos"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5785-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> When "
"chooosing an action for a gesture, you will see a special item in the list "
"named <span class=\"ui\">pass through</span>. This action is used to keep "
"the default behavior of that gesture, like text selection when long pressing "
"near the corners. If you want to disable a gesture to avoid accidental "
"actions, choose <span class=\"ui\">nothing</span> as the action. In other "
"words <span class=\"ui\">pass through</span>=<b>another handler might act on "
"it</b>, <span class=\"ui\">nothing</span>=<b>swallow the action</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Información contextual\"></span> Ao "
"escoller unha acción para un xesto, verás na lista un elemento especial "
"chamado <span class=\"ui\">Atravesar</span>. Esta acción úsase para manter o "
"comportamento predeterminado dese xesto, como a selección de texto ao facer "
"unha pulsación longa preto das esquinas. Se queres desactivar un xesto para "
"evitar accións accidentais, escolle <span class=\"ui\">nada</span> como "
"acción. Noutras palabras: <span class=\"ui\">Atravesar</span>=<b>outro "
"xestor pode actuar sobre el</b>, <span class=\"ui\">nada</span>=<b>absorber "
"a acción</b>."

